---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Privacy Policy"
  description="www.humanaifit.com Privacy Policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal information."
  lang="en"
  path="/en/privacy/"
>
  <section class="section" style="padding-top:100px;">
    <div class="container" style="max-width:720px;">
      <p class="section-label">Legal</p>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="font-size:14px;color:var(--color-text-muted);">Last updated: June 2026</p>

      <h2>1. Who We Are</h2>
      <p>This website www.humanaifit.com is operated by Beacon Consulting (彼恳企业管理咨询). We are committed to protecting your personal data privacy.</p>

      <h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>2.1 Information You Provide</h3>
      <p>When using our services, you may provide:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Name</strong> — for personalized communication</li>
        <li><strong>Email address</strong> — for delivering reports and important notices</li>
        <li><strong>Company name</strong> — to understand your business context</li>
      </ul>
      <p>This information is stored securely on our servers and used solely to deliver the services you request.</p>
      <div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;">
        <strong>🛡️ Diagnostic Data Never Uploaded</strong>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;">Your HS codes, product information, and export volumes entered in the CBAM tool stay in your browser only (localStorage) — never uploaded to our servers. Only you can see this data.</p>
      </div>

      <h3>2.2 Automatically Collected Information</h3>
      <p>This website uses basic server logs (access time, page URL, browser type) for operation and performance optimization — not for user profiling.</p>

      <h2>3. How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>Your information is used solely for:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Delivering CBAM reports and resources you request</li>
        <li>Sending policy update notifications (with your explicit consent)</li>
        <li>Improving website and service experience</li>
      </ul>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#666;padding:8px 12px;background:#fff8e1;border-radius:6px;">📘 Legal basis: PIPL Art. 13 (consent), GDPR Art. 6 (consent)</p>

      <h2>4. Information Sharing</h2>
      <div style="margin:16px 0;padding:12px 16px;background:#e8f5e9;border-radius:8px;border-left:4px solid #4caf50;">
        <strong>🤝 We Do Not Share</strong>
        <p style="margin:4px 0 0;font-size:13px;">We never sell, trade, or transfer your personal information to third parties, except: with your explicit consent, when required by law or government authorities, or to protect our legal rights.</p>
      </div>

      <h2>5. Data Retention & Deletion</h2>
      <p>Server-stored data: retained for the duration of the business relationship, up to 12 months after last interaction.</p>
      <p>Browser-local data (localStorage): auto-expires after 7 days. You may also clear browser cache to delete at any time.</p>
      <p>You may request deletion of your personal data at any time. Email <a href="mailto:connie@humanaifit.com">connie@humanaifit.com</a> — we will respond within 72 hours.</p>

      <h2>6. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>Under applicable law, you have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>📋 Access — know what data we hold about you</li>
        <li>✏️ Rectification — correct inaccurate information</li>
        <li>🗑️ Erasure — request deletion of your data</li>
        <li>⏸️ Restriction — limit processing under certain conditions</li>
        <li>📦 Portability — receive structured, machine-readable copies</li>
        <li>↩️ Withdraw consent — without affecting prior processing lawfulness</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>This website may contain links to third-party sites. We are not responsible for their privacy practices.</p>

      <h2>8. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For privacy inquiries or to exercise your data rights:</p>
      <p>Email: <a href="mailto:connie@humanaifit.com">connie@humanaifit.com</a></p>
      <p style="font-size:13px;color:#666;">We commit to responding within 72 hours.</p>

      <h2>9. Policy Updates</h2>
      <p>We may update this Privacy Policy from time to time. Material changes will be posted on this website.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>